      "headline": "A new capital",
      "body": "Constantine dedicated his new capital, Constantinople, on the site of the Greek city of Byzantium in 330 CE. It stood on the Bosporus, the strait between Europe and Asia, controlling the route between the Black Sea and the Mediterranean.",
